This page describes the task linked from every edit summary of [[User:NVAImportBot|NVAImportBot]].
Operator: [[User:Ajarmund|Ajarmund]]. Source code: https://github.com/andjar/nva-wikidata-bot

== Source ==
[https://nva.sikt.no Nasjonalt vitenarkiv] (NVA) is the Norwegian national archive of research output, run by
[https://sikt.no Sikt]. It replaced Cristin. Data is read from the public API (https://api.nva.unit.no):
person profiles (<code>/cristin/person/{id}</code>) and publications (<code>/search/resources</code>).
Only NVA person profiles marked ''verified'' and publications with status ''PUBLISHED'' are used.

