== References ==
Person data: {{P|248}} = NVA, {{P|2287}} = the profile id, {{P|813}} = date read.<br>
Work data: {{P|248}} = NVA, {{P|854}} = <code>https://nva.sikt.no/registration/…</code>, {{P|813}} = date read.<br>
If an identical statement already exists, the reference is added to it instead of adding a second statement.

== Rules ==
; Matching works
: A DOI or handle match must also agree with Wikidata on title (similarity ≥ 0.8) and year (± 1), otherwise the item is not edited.
; Duplicates
: Values are normalised before comparison (DOI case, URL forms of DOI/handle/ORCID). A value present in any rank, including deprecated, is never added again.
; Conflicts
: If the item has a different value for {{P|496}} or {{P|356}}, or the value is already used on another item, nothing is written and the case is listed at [[User:NVAImportBot/NVA/Review]].
; Authors
: {{P|50}} is only added for contributors whose NVA person ID is on exactly one Wikidata item. A matching {{P|2093}} is converted (series ordinal kept, name kept as {{P|1932}}). Otherwise {{P|50}} is added only if the NVA position in the author list is free.
; Employer
: NVA has no start or end dates. Current affiliations are added without dates; the reference's {{P|813}} says when it was true. Former affiliations are not added. An existing employer statement gets a missing position qualifier and a reference, never a duplicate. Institutions and positions are mapped by hand-checked lists in the bot configuration.
; Handles
: The NVA handle is added when the item has no handle, or already has a handle of the same NVA record. Items with an unrelated handle are left alone and reported.

== Precautions ==
* Dry runs (reports only) before every new task or larger change.
* Edit budget per run; circuit breaker after repeated errors; <code>maxlag=5</code>; one atomic edit per item with edit-conflict detection.
* Stops on any talk page message, when [[User:NVAImportBot/Stop]] does not say <code>run</code>, or on a local stop file.
* Every decision is logged; runs are [[Wikidata:Edit groups|edit groups]] and can be undone as a whole.

== Schedule ==
Weekly: <code>persons</code> (Mondays), <code>works</code> for records changed since the last run (Wednesdays), <code>doi-handles</code> (Fridays).

== Reports ==
* [[User:NVAImportBot/NVA/Stats]] – statistics, updated after each run
* [[User:NVAImportBot/NVA/Review]] – conflicts and suggestions for humans
